Narrator: So everyone called her Little Red Riding Hood.

4
00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:23.735
R. Hood: What a beautiful day it is!

5
00:00:23.755 --> 00:00:26.057
Hello, birdie!

6
00:00:26.077 --> 00:00:28.079
[n3@Good morning, Mr.

