24
00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:36.313
Narrator: Just then, Little Red Riding Hood walked by.

25
00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:39.675
Narrator: She stopped when she saw the wolf.

26
00:01:39.695 --> 00:01:41.976
R. Hood: Oh, hello, Mr.

27
00:01:42.056 --> 00:01:46.338
Wolf. Wolf: Now she looks very tasty.

28
00:01:47.479 --> 00:01:48.820
Good day, little girl.

29
00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:50.601
Where are you going?

30
