Narrator: The wolf watched her go.

43
00:02:34.254 --> 00:02:35.255
He had a plan.

44
00:02:35.275 --> 00:02:38.978
Wolf: I'll run to her grandma's house and wait.

45
00:02:40.059 --> 00:02:46.764
Then when she comes Narrator: The wolf ran through the forest to Grandma's house.

46
