Then you can put her in too.

81
00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.841
R. Hood: Grandma!

82
00:04:59.861 --> 00:05:01.662
Narrator: Don't worry.

83
00:05:02.843 --> 00:05:07.265
Grandma wasn't really going to let [n3@the wolf eat Little Red Riding Hood.

84
00:05:07.285 --> 00:05:09.707
Narrator: Grandma had a plan too.

85
00:05:09.727 --> 00:05:11.448
Wolf: Hurry up!

86
