89
00:05:18.508 --> 00:05:22.551
Narrator: The vegetables Grandma put in the pot were hot chili peppers.

90
00:05:22.571 --> 00:05:26.394
Narrator: She stirred the soup with a big wooden spoon.

91
00:05:29.237 --> 00:05:30.478
Grandma: Mmm!

92
00:05:31.338 --> 00:05:32.599
Taste this, Mr.

93
