Wolf. Wolf: Argh!

94
00:05:36.122 --> 00:05:37.283
It's burning my mouth!

95
00:05:38.404 --> 00:05:39.565
Grandma: Oh no!

96
00:05:40.065 --> 00:05:41.466
Here, eat this.

97
00:05:42.067 --> 00:05:43.148
You'll feel better.

98
00:05:43.168 --> 00:05:45.129
Wolf: Ow!

99
00:05:45.690 --> 00:05:46.931
My mouth is on fire!

100
00:05:46.951 --> 00:05:50.469
