101
00:05:51.189 --> 00:05:52.490
Have some water.

102
00:05:54.912 --> 00:05:55.212
Wolf: Argh!

103
00:05:55.452 --> 00:05:57.094
Help! Get me out of here!

104
00:05:57.114 --> 00:06:05.960
Argh! Narrator: With his mouth, tongue, and throat on fire, the wolf ran [n3@out of Grandma's house as

105
